  * SECURITY UPDATE: Path traversal in submodule.
    - debian/patches/CVE-2026-53584.patch: Ensure that we do not try to load
      a submodule who has a filesystem path that points outside of our
      repository in src/libgit2/submodule.c and src/util/fs_path.h.
    - CVE-2026-53584
  * SECURITY UPDATE: Memory exhaustion in delta apply.
    - debian/patches/CVE-2026-53585.patch: Prevent overly large sized
      objects in packfiles in include/git2/common.h, src/libgit2/delta.c,
      src/libgit2/indexer.c, and src/libgit2/settings.c
    - CVE-2026-53585
  * SECURITY UPDATE: Credential leakage in HTTP transport.
    - debian/patches/CVE-2026-53586.patch: Give the URL of the current host
      in src/libgit2/transports/http.c.
    - CVE-2026-53586
  * SECURITY UPDATE: Out-of-bounds read in smart-pkt transport.
    - debian/patches/CVE-2026-53587.patch: Ensure that the current packet
      buffer is large enough in src/libgit2/transports/smart_pkt.c
    - CVE-2026-53587
